# UWP/Electron → Tauri v2 Capability & Gap Matrix

## UWP / WinRT

| Capability | Tauri path | Severity | Source |
|---|---|---|---|
| Toast notifications | custom Rust command | Partial | [doc](https://docs.rs/tauri-winrt-notification) |
| Protocol activation (custom URI scheme) | plugin: tauri-plugin-deep-link | Full | [doc](https://v2.tauri.app/plugin/) |
| Secure credential storage (PasswordVault) | plugin: tauri-plugin-stronghold | Partial | [doc](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/uwp/api/windows.security.credentials.passwordvault) |
| Background tasks | custom Rust command | Partial | [doc](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/apps/develop/launch/create-and-register-a-background-task) |
| Live Tiles | **no viable path** | None | [doc](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/uwp/launch-resume/update-a-live-tile-from-a-background-task) |
| Share Target contract | **no viable path** | None | [doc](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/uwp/app-to-app/receive-data) |
| App services (inter-app RPC) | **OPEN QUESTION** | None | [doc](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/uwp/launch-resume/how-to-create-and-consume-an-app-service) |

## Electron

| Capability | Tauri path | Severity | Source |
|---|---|---|---|
| Main/renderer IPC | native | Full | [doc](https://www.electronjs.org/docs/latest/tutorial/ipc) |
| Tray icon + menu | native | Full | [doc](https://v2.tauri.app/concept/architecture/) |
| Global shortcuts | plugin: tauri-plugin-global-shortcut | Full | [doc](https://v2.tauri.app/plugin/) |
| Auto-update | plugin: tauri-plugin-updater | Full | [doc](https://v2.tauri.app/plugin/) |
| Deep links / custom protocol | plugin: tauri-plugin-deep-link | Full | [doc](https://v2.tauri.app/plugin/) |
| Native Node modules | sidecar process | Partial | [doc](https://evilmartians.com/chronicles/making-desktop-apps-with-revved-up-potential-rust-tauri-sidecar) |
| PowerMonitor (sleep/wake/battery) | **OPEN QUESTION** | None | [doc](https://www.electronjs.org/docs/latest/api/power-monitor) |
